      "items": [
        "Sir C. Sankaran Nair resigned from the Viceroy's Executive Council in protest against the Jallianwala Bagh massacre (1919).",
        "K.R. Narayanan was the first Keralite and the first member of the Dalit community to become the President of India.",
        "Accamma Cherian was named the 'Jhansi Rani of Travancore' by Mahatma Gandhi for her heroic role in the freedom struggle."
